# Secrets never enter a build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies and build output are rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Not needed to build or run any image.
.git
.github
.husky
.claude
.mcp.json
docs
assets-src
infra/aws
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/src/generated
